src/stats.ts contains four statistical functions (sum, mean, median/quantile,
and standardDeviation/variance) ported verbatim from simple-statistics v7.9.0,
with one audited simplification noted in the file (sort-based quantile in place
of quickselect, proven numerically identical by src/stats.equivalence.test.ts).

